# Feature Folder Structure

Keep related code in feature folders. Do not dump new files into flat roots when a feature package already exists.

## Backend / ML (`src/{feature}/`)

```
src/
├── dataset/          # Ingest properties + curves → processed CSVs
├── train/            # Peak & curve model training, metrics, SHAP
├── predict/          # Load joblib models; predict peak / curve
└── shared/           # Schema constants, IO, plotting helpers used by 2+ features
```

Each feature package:

```
{feature}/
├── __init__.py
├── service.py        # Callable API (import from apps/web and scripts)
└── ...               # Colocated helpers only for this feature
```

## Web (`apps/web/`)

```
apps/web/
├── streamlit_app.py          # Thin: tabs, wiring, no heavy logic
├── components/               # charts, forms, metric tables
│   ├── data_charts.py
│   ├── results_charts.py
│   ├── curve_charts.py
│   └── predict_form.py
└── pages/                    # Optional Streamlit multipage (thin)
```

Mirror domain names: a new **predict** UI control lives in `components/` and calls `src.predict.service`.

## Docs (`apps/docs/`)

```
apps/docs/
├── index.md
├── core/
│   └── platform-guide.md     # Canonical living domain doc + Changelog
└── guides/
    ├── getting-started.md
    ├── data-schema.md
    └── ml-pipeline.md
```

## Tests (`tests/{feature}/`)

Mirror `src/{feature}/`. Do not put feature tests only at `tests/` root.

## Samples (`samples/`)

Downloaded PEER (and later ANSYS) source data lives here — not under `apps/`. See `samples/README.md`. Processed ML tables still go to `data/processed/`.

## Plans (`plans/`)

Numbered plans: `plans/001-short-title.md` with a status row in `plans/README.md`.

## Rules

1. **New data ingest logic** → `src/dataset/`, not `scripts/` (scripts may only call the service).
2. **New model / metric** → `src/train/`.
3. **New inference API** → `src/predict/`.
4. **New chart/form** → `apps/web/components/`; wire from `streamlit_app.py`.
5. **Shared by 2+ features** → `src/shared/` (extract only after repetition).
6. **Do not** leave duplicates at both flat and nested paths after a move.
7. Streamlit stays thin: import feature services; put logic in `src/`.
8. When adding a **new feature folder**, update this rule and `platform-guide.md` in the same change.
